{"ID":"20240522082224-rllc5lo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082224-rllc5lo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082224-rllc5lo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522105947-8e2odkw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522110017-h3hkwwv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522110017-h3hkwwv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"今年七、八月的硬皮症醫案更新","type":"doc","updated":"20240522110017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105947-8e2odkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105947-8e2odkw","updated":"20240522105947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同學們還記得這位患有硬皮症的病患嗎？她原先是位洗腎病患，於三年前到我診所求診，經過我三個月的治療後，就恢復正常了，後來再經過幫她洗腎的醫師宣佈，她不再需要洗腎了，當時我幫她治療腎衰竭時，就發現她的手指無法緊握，指關節非常的硬，我有提醒過她，她身上必然還有其他的問題存在，等到將她腎臟功能恢復後，我再幫她檢查，之後她因為被她的醫師宣告她不再需要洗腎後，我想她是過於興奮，於是忘記我的提醒，直到今年七月時，她才來找我治療，當時她來時就已經先被西醫宣佈她得到的是硬皮症，無藥可醫，也不知道是何原因造成的，只有等死一路。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105947-rr9jwsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105947-rr9jwsu","updated":"20240522105947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    今天她到診所來，正好適逢聖誕節前夕，又聽Jack大叔說，同學們都很關心她的病情發展，所以她特別寫封信給大家，告訴大家她一切安好，病情現在是持續的進步中，請大家放心，她對中醫是很有信心的，同時她要跟大家問好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105947-yn2ovqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105947-yn2ovqi","updated":"20240522105947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    跟診同學都有治療她這硬皮症的處方，請注意老師的提醒，處方絕對不可以外洩給任何人，以免有不屑人士拿去敲詐病人，說什麼可以保證治好這種話，然後要收取病人十萬美金等惡劣的行為，同學們務必遵守師門的規定，這樣大家才有機會共享最優質的經方治療處方。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105947-93oibpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105947-93oibpn","updated":"20240522105947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   下面就是她寫的信，請同學看看，外人不必看，因為跟你們沒有關係。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105947-dyfcy7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105947-dyfcy7f","updated":"20240522105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dear Students, "}]},{"ID":"20240522105954-slrtcc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105954-slrtcc8","updated":"20240522105957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12/21/2010"}]},{"ID":"20240522110003-qoaywtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110003-qoaywtt","updated":"20240522110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"This is Susan, the patient with the rubber skin, I am feeling good, my skin is improving but I still have a long way to go."}]},{"ID":"20240522110003-12l302q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110003-12l302q","updated":"20240522110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" I had a pink sore on my index finger that kind of looked like a blood blister for over 3 years and it is almost gone, the rubber skin is getting smaller but"}]},{"ID":"20240522110003-4bv7eid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110003-4bv7eid","updated":"20240522110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" the part that is small is still pretty hard.  Thank you all for asking about me, I saw Dr Andrew today and he say my spleen is stronger and my mucous around my heart is better, but still not perfect.  So, I am still taking Dr,Ni's prescription and the HT-32.  You all and Dr,Ni make me very happy."}]},{"ID":"20240522110003-4hwmfk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110003-4hwmfk4","updated":"20240522110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Thank you for your concern."}]},{"ID":"20240522110003-a817lg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110003-a817lg0","updated":"20240522110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Susan"}]},{"ID":"20240522110006-j3wxjdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110006-j3wxjdw"}},{"ID":"20240522110009-jumc8vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110009-jumc8vr","updated":"20240522110009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 由於我無法將其原文放置在這裡，所以只能將其原文一字不做更改的打字在這裡，有興趣看原文信的同學，可以寫信給老師，老師可以轉寄給你。這封信是經過病人同意登載於我的網頁上的，目的只是方便讓當時親身參與跟診的同學，了解她現在的病情發展如何，僅此而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240522110009-qwz7ycg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110009-qwz7ycg","updated":"20240522110015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 硬皮症目前對西醫而言是絕症，只有等死一條路，早期的硬皮症給中醫治療，就有機會痊癒，如果到了晚期才來找中醫，就只能做到延長一些病人的壽命。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522110009-jkyu2tm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110009-jkyu2tm","updated":"20240522110013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"請注意，本醫案將於二週後歸檔到人紀同學精采案例篇中。"}]},{"ID":"20240522110016-m1p6j9y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522110016-m1p6j9y"}},{"ID":"20240522110017-h3hkwwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522110017-h3hkwwv"}}]}